    "gaps": [
      "The constant false dependency-map-only argument makes the candidate early branch unreachable. Its native enter/snapshot functions and MCP snapshot tool remain available and are tested separately; the active hub graph specializes that branch away.",
      "Specialization uses registered workstation defaults and the canonical matrix with at most three rfde rows. Other profiles and larger selections remain outside this contract.",
      "Hub admission, preflight, dry-run, 900-second outer timeout and final repository write audit remain outside this run(args) graph; native per-check audits and 180/240/120-second timeouts remain inside run_check.",
      "Network and external capabilities remain subject to service qualification. Lunar supplies execution receipts; native reports, fingerprints, dependency snapshots and publication stdout are preserved."
    ]
  },
  "extensions": {
    "mathformer.source": {
      "category": "hub",
      "native_id": "test:family:rfde",
      "owner_skill": "skills/control/workflow-contract-validator/SKILL.md",
      "contract": {
        "id": "test:family:rfde",
        "family": "rfde",
